-- Conquest of Azeroth class trainers of Camp Narache (Red Cloud Mesa, map 1): the eleven trainers, the
-- intro letters 55100-55110 that Grull Hawkwind hands out after The Hunt Begins (747), and the first
-- class chains (16 quests). Generated by .agents/plans/coa-world/tools/gen_ct_narache.py; the trainer
-- kits (trainer 900000+c, class menus 930000+c) come from rev_20260923_05_coa_class_trainer_core.sql.
