-- WHERE EACH VALUE COMES FROM
--   trainer posts  SOURCED-CLIENT: the QuestSuperTrack turn-in point of each letter (8 of 11). Jax
--     Dawnsoar, Nawat Windhorn and Apprentice Yahk Loregrain have no point; their posts are hand-picked
--     (INFERRED) and every post keeps 2.5 yd from every kept NPC.
--   names  SOURCED-CACHE creaturecache for the nine cached trainers; Jax and Nawat are named by their
--     letters (no cache record, new entries 9300300/9300301).
--   looks  stand-ins: no SMSG_MIRRORIMAGE_DATA capture of any of these trainers exists. Each preset
--     copies a stock tauren NPC's look and changes customization and one or two pieces.
--   gossip  cached CoA texts: Galak Twoclubs 87571, Oko'une 30501/130501, Amuwate 32037/132037 and
--     Sunwalker Thunderhorn 40042/240042 get named menus; the others use the class menu 930000+c.
--   quests  SOURCED-CACHE questcache rows; givers and chain links INFERRED from the texts (see the
--     dossiers in .agents/plans/coa-world/quests/). RewardNextQuest from the cache inside this file.
--   chain places  INFERRED from the quest texts, hand-placed on Red Cloud Mesa and checked against the
--     server floor and the navmesh: the Mu'sha shrine, the hidden statue, Scorch's campfire, the falcon
--     Keed, the Lost Pendant at the quilboar camp, Onacona Warheart in the chief's lodge.
--   drops  SOURCED-EXILES creature_loot (Small Sword and Power Core from Bristleback Quilboar, 33 %).
--   letters' page_text  10306 is cached (SOURCED-CACHE); the other ten are written in the same form
--     (INFERRED). The falcon Note 662316 (page 11112) is shared by all six ranger chains and is
--     written once, by the Deathknell class trainer migration (its bulletin claim).
--
-- Stock rows: Gart Mistrunner (guid 26898, stock druid trainer) stands 0.17 yd from Sunwalker
-- Thunderhorn's SOURCED post and steps aside in rev_20260924_13. The other Camp Narache NPCs stay
-- where they are.
